<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's BES to present results Feb 4.</title>
<headline>Portugal's BES to present results Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese bank Banco Espirito Santo said it would present its 1996 results at 1600 GMT on February 4.</p>
